{
 "_source": "Ryan Boren's brief, 2026-10-11: a shopfront for selling wool goods, meat, milk, eggs, cheese, produce and the rest from All Together Now Farms and its neighbours in Nature's Contribution, everything properly pasteurised with respect for lawful and ethical food safety, no raw milk. His answers the same afternoon: it is a shopfront on the street, and it sells by honesty box, prices on a board, money in a box, nobody watching. Read by tools/make-the-honesty-box.py.",
